1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Sixth Episode
The Little Goblin

15
00:01:52,021 --> 00:01:54,455
On an island in the South,

16
00:01:55,701 --> 00:01:57,737
in the Southern sea,

17
00:01:58,821 --> 00:02:04,453
there is a little elf
who plays and wants to play!

18
00:02:06,261 --> 00:02:08,729
On that island in the South,

19
00:02:10,581 --> 00:02:12,811
in the blue Southern sea,

20
00:02:12,861 --> 00:02:18,015
there is a cheeky elf
who knows how to use his magic!

21
00:02:21,621 --> 00:02:24,010
Even if it's not very pretty,
this is my boat,

22
00:02:24,061 --> 00:02:26,017
so please
don't laugh at it!

23
00:02:26,061 --> 00:02:28,495
- It's not ugly! It's just funny!
- I like it!

24
00:02:32,021 --> 00:02:33,693
How fun!

25
00:02:34,701 --> 00:02:38,091
I feel like a sailor!
But what do I see?

26
00:02:38,781 --> 00:02:40,533
I see something..

27
00:02:42,341 --> 00:02:44,491
And what is this?
A seashell...

28
00:02:44,901 --> 00:02:46,892
Let me out, please!

29
00:02:46,941 --> 00:02:48,772
- I hear a voice...
- Let me out!

30
00:02:48,821 --> 00:02:50,652
Help me!

31
00:02:53,741 --> 00:02:56,335
Please, let me out!

32
00:02:59,021 --> 00:03:00,818
Heavens, what a surprise!

33
00:03:08,421 --> 00:03:10,298
Where is he? Where is he? Where is he?

34
00:03:10,341 --> 00:03:13,014
It's costing me dearly to follow
Prince Sapphire on his vacation!

35
00:03:14,621 --> 00:03:17,579
I can't do anything about it at all,
damn it!

36
00:03:20,301 --> 00:03:22,576
It's an order
from Grand Duke Geralamon.

37
00:03:26,221 --> 00:03:29,497
- Here comes that little angel!
- There is an elf inside here!

38
00:03:29,541 --> 00:03:31,532
An elf in a seashell?!

39
00:03:32,021 --> 00:03:34,819
Yes! They had locked me
in here!

40
00:03:34,861 --> 00:03:37,011
Thank you for saving me

41
00:03:37,061 --> 00:03:39,336
He says he comes
from a distant southern island..

42
00:03:39,381 --> 00:03:41,497
...and that he was
dragged all the way here,

43
00:03:41,541 --> 00:03:43,736
always locked inside his shell.

44
00:03:44,541 --> 00:03:47,101
What is your father's name,
little elf?

45
00:03:47,341 --> 00:03:49,536
His name is Genie.

46
00:03:50,181 --> 00:03:53,730
Did you say "Genie"? But isn't he
the spirit of the magic lamp,

47
00:03:53,781 --> 00:03:55,897
the one from the fairy tales
of "One Thousand and One Nights"?

48
00:03:55,941 --> 00:03:59,377
Yes, he used to be in the lamp,
but now he is old...

49
00:03:59,421 --> 00:04:02,333
...and prefers to live on
an island in the South Seas.

50
00:04:02,661 --> 00:04:05,892
Ah, the genie of the magic
lamp! Ah, interesting news!

51
00:04:05,941 --> 00:04:09,297
I heard that the magic
lamp granted every wish...

52
00:04:09,341 --> 00:04:12,458
- Shut up!
- My father granted wishes.

53
00:04:12,501 --> 00:04:15,652
...of whoever possessed the magic
lamp, but he stopped doing so!

54
00:04:15,701 --> 00:04:18,898
Since you saved me, I will
have your wishes granted.

55
00:04:18,941 --> 00:04:21,250
In return, I ask you only one thing.

56
00:04:21,581 --> 00:04:25,654
If I get you what you want do
you promise to take me back home?

57
00:04:25,701 --> 00:04:28,056
I mean, I want to say,
on the South Seas island!

58
00:04:28,101 --> 00:04:31,252
My father hasn't seen me in a long
time and he must be worried!

59
00:04:31,301 --> 00:04:33,132
I heard a noise!

60
00:04:33,541 --> 00:04:36,931
- That's..! Do you believe it, Choppy?
- I do! And you, Sapphire?

61
00:04:37,381 --> 00:04:40,020
I think he told
a pack of lies!

62
00:04:40,061 --> 00:04:42,575
- I think he's a liar!
- NO! What I told you is true..

63
00:04:42,621 --> 00:04:45,135
...and I'll prove it to you
if you take me home!

64
00:04:45,181 --> 00:04:47,251
I can't bring myself to believe
his words!

65
00:04:50,021 --> 00:04:52,330
Sapphire, I feel sorry for that poor guy

66
00:04:52,941 --> 00:04:55,330
It's none of my business!
You keep him!

67
00:04:55,381 --> 00:04:57,019
Sapphire, wait!

68
00:05:00,301 --> 00:05:02,769
The genie of the magic lamp
grants every wish,

69
00:05:02,821 --> 00:05:04,812
so if I can catch
that pixie..!

70
00:05:08,901 --> 00:05:10,539
What are you doing, Baron Neelon?

71
00:05:10,581 --> 00:05:12,173
Hello, Your Highness! I was just passing by!

72
00:05:12,221 --> 00:05:15,497
Liar! That will teach you to lie!

73
00:05:15,901 --> 00:05:18,620
Actually, I was on my way
to your castle!

74
00:05:18,941 --> 00:05:20,852
Then hurry on over there!

75
00:05:20,901 --> 00:05:23,620
- Of course, Your Highness!
- Wait for me, I'm coming with you!

76
00:05:27,661 --> 00:05:29,731
This Sapphire
is really a fool.

77
00:05:42,541 --> 00:05:45,738
I didn't like Sapphire.
He was truly heartless.

78
00:05:45,781 --> 00:05:47,737
Don't worry, little elf

79
00:05:48,261 --> 00:05:51,412
I will take you to your home,
on that island in the South Seas.

80
00:05:54,581 --> 00:05:57,573
Wait, little one! Don't go
out to sea! Give me that elf!

81
00:05:57,901 --> 00:05:59,892
I wouldn't even think of it!

82
00:06:08,301 --> 00:06:10,178
So much the worse for you! Now I...

83
00:06:10,221 --> 00:06:12,576
Hey!
How come you came back?

84
00:06:12,621 --> 00:06:15,374
It's dangerous for little ones
to play with boats, and I...

85
00:06:15,420 --> 00:06:17,412
Choppy, come back to shore!

86
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:20,095
Choppy, do you hear me? Come back, I said!

87
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:24,015
You said you didn't believe
his words.

88
00:06:26,100 --> 00:06:29,855
Stop! Don't be foolish! You won't
manage to reach the island!

89
00:06:31,740 --> 00:06:33,618
How stubborn!

90
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:38,018
Listen to me, Choppy!
In the sea there are sharks

91
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:41,576
...that eat men and
whales and other monstrous animals!

92
00:06:42,740 --> 00:06:44,459
Now you'll see!

93
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:48,537
Do you want to leave me alone?

94
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:50,890
Listen, Choppy,
I would like to go home.

95
00:06:50,940 --> 00:06:53,739
I will take you there! For now you can
stay in my hat.

96
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:56,612
Choppy is really hospitable!

97
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:58,538
I don't want to go back!
Let me go!

98
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:00,299
The shark!

99
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:04,131
Watch out, Choppy! Run!

100
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,173
Help!

101
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:12,013
Here!

102
00:07:18,140 --> 00:07:19,813
Try to catch me!

103
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:26,420
Run, Choppy!
I'll try to help you!

104
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:30,333
There it is!

105
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:34,292
Oh my, there are so many
of them! It's a whole pack!

106
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:05,020
Hooray, I'm saved!
Maybe I made it!

107
00:08:05,060 --> 00:08:07,814
I wonder if this is the island of
the South Seas..! Who knows?

108
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:32,731
Hey, but that
looks like a whale to me!

109
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:37,730
Choppy, that's not
an island! It's a whale!

110
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:40,295
A whale?! I thought it
was a Southern island!

111
00:08:48,181 --> 00:08:49,819
Help!

112
00:08:50,541 --> 00:08:53,294
Here! Take the anchor, Choppy!

113
00:08:53,341 --> 00:08:55,093
I missed it!

114
00:08:56,461 --> 00:08:58,258
Don't go down, Choppy!

115
00:09:00,421 --> 00:09:03,140
Too late!
Now it's going too fast!

116
00:09:09,901 --> 00:09:12,813
I should run for it, but I
can't abandon Choppy!

117
00:09:24,821 --> 00:09:26,652
An island!

118
00:09:28,621 --> 00:09:30,771
It's going to crash into the island!

119
00:09:37,061 --> 00:09:39,291
It won't even stop
on dry land!

120
00:09:39,341 --> 00:09:41,935
I have to stop it!
I've got it!

121
00:09:54,901 --> 00:09:57,574
What's down there? A ship!

122
00:09:57,621 --> 00:09:59,896
Hey, the ship!

123
00:10:04,261 --> 00:10:06,217
What a crash!

124
00:10:21,861 --> 00:10:24,534
But it's not a dinosaur,
it's a rock!

125
00:10:38,301 --> 00:10:41,259
Help! Help, Sapphire!
I can't swim!

126
00:10:41,301 --> 00:10:44,373
- Hold onto my hand!
- I can't reach!

127
00:10:45,821 --> 00:10:48,176
Now I can touch the bottom.

128
00:10:48,341 --> 00:10:51,174
How come? I can touch too.

129
00:10:51,461 --> 00:10:55,090
What could it be, Sapphire?
Can you explain this mystery?

130
00:10:55,821 --> 00:10:58,699
- Look!
- What do you think it is?

131
00:10:58,741 --> 00:11:00,652
I don't know.

132
00:11:01,101 --> 00:11:03,410
It's a flying manta ray, Choppy!

133
00:11:07,581 --> 00:11:11,130
Hold on tight! Here's another one!

134
00:11:37,021 --> 00:11:38,818
Sapphire!

135
00:11:55,501 --> 00:11:59,380
Where could I be? I'm lost
in the middle of the ocean!

136
00:12:00,021 --> 00:12:02,899
An island!
It's the South Seas island!

137
00:12:08,141 --> 00:12:11,019
Hooray, I've arrived!
It's the island! Finally!

138
00:12:11,741 --> 00:12:13,493
But where is Sapphire?

139
00:12:13,541 --> 00:12:16,897
I've got it! I'll light a fire
to let her know where I am!

140
00:12:22,141 --> 00:12:23,813
I hope she sees the smoke

141
00:12:23,901 --> 00:12:26,369
What is it? Ah, it's you
who spoke! What are you?

142
00:12:26,421 --> 00:12:28,332
- Let me go!
- A dinosaur!

143
00:12:28,701 --> 00:12:30,612
Ah, is that so? Come on!

144
00:12:31,021 --> 00:12:34,297
- So many monsters!
- What's happening? Why did you call?

145
00:12:34,341 --> 00:12:36,218
Let's teach them a lesson!

146
00:12:36,781 --> 00:12:38,737
Better run for it!
How strange..!

147
00:12:38,781 --> 00:12:41,454
On this island, trees and
animals are smaller than normal!

148
00:12:41,501 --> 00:12:43,571
Maybe this
is the elf's island!

149
00:12:43,621 --> 00:12:45,816
Come here, see if you
recognize the island!

150
00:12:51,821 --> 00:12:53,698
I'm scared, Choppy! I'm scared!

151
00:12:53,741 --> 00:12:56,699
This is not my island!
This is a very strange place!

152
00:12:57,021 --> 00:12:59,012
- Get off our island!
- Get lost!

153
00:12:59,061 --> 00:13:01,131
Did you see how I chased him away?

154
00:13:03,101 --> 00:13:05,410
This bird
is as small as a fly.

155
00:13:07,421 --> 00:13:10,413
Help! Help!
A swarm of them is coming!

156
00:13:10,461 --> 00:13:14,249
Damn, they don't intend
to stop! Help! Help!

157
00:13:23,021 --> 00:13:26,331
Yes, I definitely want to leave
this place! But how do I do it?

158
00:13:27,581 --> 00:13:29,299
Here's the solution!

159
00:13:29,341 --> 00:13:31,696
This small-scale whirlwind
will carry me away!

160
00:13:31,741 --> 00:13:34,733
How wonderful! It feels
like I'm on a carousel!

161
00:13:40,101 --> 00:13:42,012
I see a wisp of smoke!

162
00:13:42,061 --> 00:13:45,337
Maybe there's someone on
this island! Maybe Choppy is here!

163
00:13:50,461 --> 00:13:53,100
Choppy, where are you? Choppy!

164
00:13:53,901 --> 00:13:57,291
Look, look...! They look like
the footprints of Choppy's shoes!

165
00:14:00,501 --> 00:14:03,015
Choppy, it's me: Sapphire!

166
00:14:03,061 --> 00:14:05,052
Where are you, Choppy?

167
00:14:10,061 --> 00:14:13,497
Strange! His footprints
end on this rocky ledge!

168
00:14:13,781 --> 00:14:15,419
Could it be...

169
00:14:26,301 --> 00:14:30,214
Where am I? Where have we
ended up? A giant footprint!

170
00:14:31,221 --> 00:14:33,735
But then... There are giants!

171
00:14:33,781 --> 00:14:37,410
- Giants?!
- Don't be afraid, little elf!

172
00:14:37,461 --> 00:14:39,417
I will protect you.

173
00:14:39,621 --> 00:14:42,010
Perhaps, from the island
of dwarfs, that whirlwind...

174
00:14:42,061 --> 00:14:45,258
...has brought us to the island
of giants. You will stay in a shell.

175
00:14:45,301 --> 00:14:47,292
I don't want to stay here!

176
00:14:47,341 --> 00:14:50,811
- Everything is so huge!
- Let me out, I said!

177
00:14:50,861 --> 00:14:53,819
Please, stay quiet or
the giants will hear you!

178
00:14:55,021 --> 00:14:57,615
Oh, goodness! What could it be?

179
00:15:05,301 --> 00:15:07,815
Please, Mrs. Frog, don't eat me!

180
00:15:13,021 --> 00:15:15,979
Help! It's chasing me! Help!

181
00:15:26,261 --> 00:15:28,821
I am indigestible, Mrs. Frog!

182
00:15:29,101 --> 00:15:31,376
Where can I hide? Oh, there!

183
00:15:38,301 --> 00:15:40,815
No, don't shake too much, please!

184
00:15:41,021 --> 00:15:42,852
There are so many of them!

185
00:15:53,261 --> 00:15:56,219
- I want to get out!
- Quiet, or the giant will hear you!

186
00:15:56,821 --> 00:15:58,812
We must leave immediately!

187
00:16:14,701 --> 00:16:16,419
More frogs?!

188
00:16:16,501 --> 00:16:19,573
Welcome, little boy!

189
00:16:22,861 --> 00:16:25,011
And yet, they don't seem bad.

190
00:16:27,381 --> 00:16:29,815
I am the chief
and I welcome you!

191
00:16:29,861 --> 00:16:32,500
- No, I am the chief!
- Don't listen to him! I'm in charge!

192
00:16:33,901 --> 00:16:36,369
I gather that you want
something from me.

193
00:16:36,741 --> 00:16:39,016
Yes! Please! Help us!

194
00:16:39,061 --> 00:16:42,292
How can I help you if I don't
know the danger that threatens you?

195
00:16:45,541 --> 00:16:48,101
That man wants to eat us!

196
00:16:53,741 --> 00:16:55,732
Blast it!

197
00:16:57,541 --> 00:17:00,499
Good heavens! These
frogs are poisonous!

198
00:17:01,021 --> 00:17:04,093
I see Choppy's footprints.
He must be on this island!

199
00:17:04,421 --> 00:17:07,891
Choppy! It's me! It's Sapphire!

200
00:17:07,941 --> 00:17:10,899
Sapphire! The
giant has taken her!

201
00:17:11,301 --> 00:17:14,213
Let's see... Where is she?

202
00:17:17,821 --> 00:17:19,698
Now I can escape!

203
00:17:21,021 --> 00:17:24,536
He's so huge! I will never manage
to defeat him by normal means!

204
00:17:32,061 --> 00:17:33,733
Oh, there he is!

205
00:17:45,701 --> 00:17:47,657
I can't go any further!

206
00:18:02,781 --> 00:18:05,534
Sapphire, get out of there
or the giant will kill you!

207
00:18:11,741 --> 00:18:14,539
Damn! He's going to
make the mountain collapse!

208
00:18:15,101 --> 00:18:18,889
Here is what I'll do! I must
go to the frogs I met earlier.

209
00:18:18,941 --> 00:18:20,932
Only they can help us!

210
00:18:22,261 --> 00:18:24,058
May I ask a question?

211
00:18:24,101 --> 00:18:26,854
I will help you against the giant if
you tell me where you got the poison!

212
00:18:27,021 --> 00:18:29,615
We get it from
the root of a plant!

213
00:18:29,661 --> 00:18:31,891
Do you have any more of those roots?

214
00:18:32,141 --> 00:18:34,336
- Yes, of course!
- Absolutely!

215
00:18:34,901 --> 00:18:36,778
Now listen to me carefully!

216
00:18:36,821 --> 00:18:40,018
You will put some poison in
your mouth and spit it at the giant!

217
00:18:40,061 --> 00:18:42,939
- In our mouths?
- Of course! You will spit it at him!

218
00:18:43,141 --> 00:18:45,291
Alright, we understand!

219
00:18:49,261 --> 00:18:51,491
He managed
to widen the crack!

220
00:19:05,341 --> 00:19:08,697
I don't want to die in a place
like this! I must do something!

221
00:19:08,861 --> 00:19:11,295
Green and sparkling,
we are the frogs!

222
00:19:11,341 --> 00:19:13,901
Here we are, leaping,
all together we arrive!

223
00:19:16,781 --> 00:19:19,659
Stop now!
We're almost there!

224
00:19:27,421 --> 00:19:29,696
I will at least try
to cut off his finger!

225
00:19:44,701 --> 00:19:46,851
Are you ready to spit the poison?

226
00:19:49,541 --> 00:19:51,372
Spit!

227
00:19:54,341 --> 00:19:56,252
He's hit!

228
00:20:04,021 --> 00:20:06,251
Why is the giant
leaving?

229
00:20:06,461 --> 00:20:08,577
What do I see! That's Choppy!

230
00:20:09,541 --> 00:20:11,532
- Sapphire!
- Choppy!

231
00:20:11,581 --> 00:20:13,492
I am so glad
that you are safe!

232
00:20:13,541 --> 00:20:16,453
Thank the frogs! They were the
ones who chased the giant away!

233
00:20:17,021 --> 00:20:20,297
You know, by now I had lost
all hope of finding you alive.

234
00:20:22,421 --> 00:20:24,377
I'm deeply moved!

235
00:20:25,821 --> 00:20:30,611
Look! The giant is washing himself,
so he can wash off the poison!

236
00:20:39,181 --> 00:20:42,253
I think he intends to
climb all the way up here.

237
00:20:43,021 --> 00:20:46,616
I will cut the ivy, to stop
him from climbing up!

238
00:20:52,261 --> 00:20:55,492
- Let me out! It's important!
- We are still in danger!

239
00:20:55,541 --> 00:20:57,850
We could escape quickly
and you're fine where you are!

240
00:20:59,621 --> 00:21:02,135
I'm missing one, Sapphire! Only one!

241
00:21:04,021 --> 00:21:07,013
I have to get out!
I made it, finally!

242
00:21:07,061 --> 00:21:09,017
This is my island
and that is my father!

243
00:21:09,061 --> 00:21:12,258
Really? Then how do you explain
that he has a horn and you don't?

244
00:21:12,901 --> 00:21:15,859
He has it because we grow a horn
when we get angry!

245
00:21:16,421 --> 00:21:18,537
You grew one too!
Then you are his son!

246
00:21:18,581 --> 00:21:20,936
Please, don't hurt him!

247
00:21:20,981 --> 00:21:23,893
What are you doing? Stop!
That giant is my father!

248
00:21:23,941 --> 00:21:25,897
What?! Really?!

249
00:21:26,021 --> 00:21:30,139
Dad! Dad! It's me!
I'm your son!

250
00:21:30,181 --> 00:21:32,376
Little Elf! Is it really you?

251
00:21:32,421 --> 00:21:36,539
- Yes, it's me!
- My dear son!

252
00:21:39,341 --> 00:21:42,014
I'll catch you! There!

253
00:21:42,861 --> 00:21:47,252
- My little elf!
- Dear dad, I missed you so much!

254
00:21:47,541 --> 00:21:49,896
I couldn't wait to see you again!

255
00:21:55,021 --> 00:21:57,489
The last section is breaking!

256
00:21:59,501 --> 00:22:01,298
It's falling!

257
00:22:13,861 --> 00:22:16,011
I'm happy to see you again

258
00:22:16,221 --> 00:22:19,099
Me too, dad!
These two guys are my friends!

259
00:22:19,141 --> 00:22:21,735
They are so kind!
They brought me back here to you!

260
00:22:21,781 --> 00:22:25,137
I am so grateful to you! I was so worried
and anxious about my little one!

261
00:22:25,181 --> 00:22:27,695
So he is the genie
of the magic lamp!

262
00:22:28,021 --> 00:22:31,616
Promise me you will never go
to the beach to play alone again!

263
00:22:33,301 --> 00:22:35,895
I promise, Dad:
I won't ever leave you again!

264
00:22:35,941 --> 00:22:40,014
I'm sorry you were so worried
about me all this time!

265
00:22:45,461 --> 00:22:48,498
Out of gratitude,
I will grant your wishes.

266
00:22:48,741 --> 00:22:51,301
Thank you,
there is no need to trouble yourself

267
00:22:51,341 --> 00:22:54,139
- I'm sorry about the misunderstanding.
- I am too!

268
00:22:54,181 --> 00:22:56,649
But I'd like to return
your kindness.

269
00:22:56,901 --> 00:23:00,814
Then could you make it so
that Sapphire can be happy?

270
00:23:00,861 --> 00:23:03,580
I prefer to earn it
on my own, happiness.

271
00:23:03,621 --> 00:23:06,260
Dad could free you
from all your enemies.

272
00:23:06,301 --> 00:23:08,895
I will manage to get rid of them
with my own strength.

273
00:23:08,941 --> 00:23:11,694
Dad told me that a certain
Neelon chased you all the way here.

274
00:23:11,741 --> 00:23:13,493
He must have wanted to set a trap for me!

275
00:23:15,101 --> 00:23:17,092
Indeed, he certainly looked like it!

276
00:23:17,141 --> 00:23:19,336
But don't worry!
Since he seemed bad,

277
00:23:19,381 --> 00:23:21,656
I transformed him with
magic into a seagull!

278
00:23:22,261 --> 00:23:24,013
Into a seagull?!

279
00:23:34,581 --> 00:23:36,572
Have a safe trip, guys!

280
00:23:36,621 --> 00:23:40,773
- Goodbye, Genie!
- Restore Neelon to his true form!

281
00:23:42,301 --> 00:23:46,533
I really think this has
been a good lesson for him!

282
00:24:16,221 --> 00:24:19,841
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

283
00:24:19,842 --> 00:24:23,202
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

284
